  "{\"text\": \"今天天气不错，let's go shopping 吧。\", \"lang\": \"zh\", \"version\": \"v2\"}": "06c273fbd8bc0fdc",
  "{\"text\": \"今天我们来 discuss AI、機械学習と 한국어 mixing 一起。\", \"lang\": \"auto\", \"version\": \"v2\"}": "69312d8b29efc7e5",
